<title>UK: Zeneca nine months total sales up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Zeneca nine months total sales up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeneca Group Plc said on Tuesday its total group sales rose 14 percent to 4.1 billion stg in the first nine months of the year.</p>
</text>
